        "Content": "RAY COOKE LETTINGS PLEASE FOLLOW US ON FACEBOOK AND INSTAGRAM AS PROPERTIES ARE ADVERTISED THERE FIRST VIDEO VIEWINGS AVAILABLE ON REQUEST\n*** IMMACULATE 2 BEDROOM / 1 BATHROOM HOME *** REGISTER YOUR INTEREST TODAY ***\nRAY COOKE LETTINGS are delighted to present this immaculate two-bedroom, one-bathroom home to the rental market, ideally located in Newtown, Eadestown, Co. Kildare.\nPresented in excellent condition throughout, this bright and spacious property offers well-proportioned living accommodation finished to a high standard. The accommodation comprises a welcoming entrance hallway, a spacious living area, a modern fully fitted kitchen with ample storage and integrated appliances, two generous double bedrooms, and a stylish main bathroom.\nThe property has been exceptionally well maintained and is presented in turnkey condition, offering comfortable and modern living in a peaceful countryside setting. Bright interiors, quality finishes, and well-designed living spaces make this an ideal home for a wide range of tenants.\nNewtown, Eadestown enjoys a tranquil rural setting while remaining within easy reach of Naas, Kilcullen, and Blessington, where a wide range of shops, cafés, restaurants, schools, and leisure facilities can be found. The area offers excellent access to the N7, M7, and M50 road networks, providing an easy commute to Dublin City Centre and surrounding areas while allowing residents to enjoy the benefits of country living.\nThis is an excellent opportunity to secure a beautifully presented home in one of Co. Kildare's most desirable countryside locations. Early interest is highly recommended.\n \nAdditional Features:\nImmaculate 2 Bed / 1 Bath home\nBright and spacious living accommodation\nTwo generous double bedrooms\nModern fully fitted kitchen\nStylish main bathroom\nPresented in turnkey condition throughout\nPeaceful countryside location\nEasy access to Naas, Kilcullen, Blessington, the N7, M7, and M50\nRegister your interest today\n \nRAY COOKE LETTINGS EMAIL ENQUIRIES ONLY / NO PHONE CALLS PLEASE FILL IN YOUR CONTACT INFORMATION ON THE RIGHT-HAND SIDE AND CLICK SEND MESSAGE WE WILL CONTACT YOU WITH VIEWING DETAILS WHEN THEY ARISE."
